[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0010","text":"……好，今天的购物结束\n────赶紧回家吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0019","text":"客人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0020","text":"哇……！\n这束花，好漂亮啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0029","text":"花店店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0030","text":"因为是结婚贺礼\n所以包装也设计得很有婚礼氛围"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0039","text":"客人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0040","text":"谢谢……！\n呵呵，好期待送出去啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0050","text":"（我也……总有一天，能送给美琴小姐────）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0060","text":"（不不不！又、又不是那种朋友关系────\n　那么遥远的事，谁知道呢……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0062","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0070","text":"……谁啊？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0080","text":"……美琴小姐────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0090","text":"『练习室好像空出来了，你现在有时间吗？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0100","text":"（『有时间！我现在在外面，\n　　回家放下东西马上过去！』）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400200_04_0102","text":"Motion"}]
